. The sails are not affected by the rotation.\n\nUncommenting the following line fix the issue:\n\n```\nwind_force_magnitude = 10 # uncomment this line to fix the rotation\n```\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/MartinDelille/wind_test","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105759/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105759/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}